  "body": "Very rarely do two properties side by side become available. With a combined land holding of 1611m2 more or less and very good street frontage, there are lots of possibilities to explore.\r\nRC GRANTED \r\n\r\n20 Ngataringa Road\r\n3 bedrooms 3 Bathrooms, Land area 911 m2 more or less\r\n\r\n22 Ngataringa Road\r\n4 bedrooms 1 Bathrooms, Land area 700m2 more or less\r\n\r\n\r\nThese properties are situated in a quiet cul de sac and positioned very well for all day sun. \r\nEasy motorway access, close to shops , beach .\r\nZoned in Takapuna Grammar, Belmont School and Bayswater School and Belmont Intermediate.",
